window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Some pictures are worth killing for.</b><br> <br> Lara Simon has always lived in her older sister’s shadow. Mia was the perfect one—the dancer, the star, the girl everyone adored. But when Mia dies in a tragic accident, Lara finally has the chance to be seen.<br> <br> She has a plan:<br> Win the prestigious Halleigh Grant with an art portfolio no one will ever forget.<br> <br> Get the boy her sister left behind.<br> <br> Make the people who hurt her pay.<br> <br> Because some girls are born to be in the spotlight.<br> <i><br> And others will do anything to take it.</i></p> <p><b>This isn’t just a story. It’s a confession.</b></p>"; 
